{"4859490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hardy & Molly", "steam_appid": 4859490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2053, a wave of zombies swept the world. When the zombies came, the people of &quot;Winter Stone Town&quot; evacuated the town to the legendary resistance base of survivors &quot;Tamia City&quot;. During the evacuation, Hardy’s weapon &quot;liquefier&quot; malfunctioned, causing the death of his good friend Molly's mother and Molly was missing. Hardy chose to return to the uninhabited town alone under self-accusation, starting on a dangerous journey to seek Molly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must obtain the necessary survival supplies before the zombies catch you, and run to the exit. You can also use the liquefier in your hand to create traps and destroy zombies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⁃ Simple operation, only need to control the direction joystick and two function keys. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⁃ A test of brain and fingers, the correct escape route and battle timing are indispensable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⁃ Keep discovering new clues in the adventure and find the talented girl Molly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⁃ High-quality music brings a tense and thrilling zombie battle experience.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2053, a wave of zombies swept the world. When the zombies came, the people of &quot;Winter Stone Town&quot; evacuated the town to the legendary resistance base of survivors &quot;Tamia City&quot;. During the evacuation, Hardy’s weapon &quot;liquefier&quot; malfunctioned, causing the death of his good friend Molly's mother and Molly was missing. Hardy chose to return to the uninhabited town alone under self-accusation, starting on a dangerous journey to seek Molly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must obtain the necessary survival supplies before the zombies catch you, and run to the exit. You can also use the liquefier in your hand to create traps and destroy zombies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⁃ Simple operation, only need to control the direction joystick and two function keys. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⁃ A test of brain and fingers, the correct escape route and battle timing are indispensable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⁃ Keep discovering new clues in the adventure and find the talented girl Molly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⁃ High-quality music brings a tense and thrilling zombie battle experience.</p>", "short_description": "A lightweight, side-scrolling puzzle-platformer. Players use a liquefier device to alter the state of blocks while navigating platforms, ladders, and mechanisms. The goal is to dodge zombies, gather supplies, and reach the exit. Each level tests observation, timing, and route planning.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4859490/5b01994ce8f9a26be4b7b55b8221d17a65fc13fd/header.jpg?t=1787538922", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4859490/9bb90212c4536f8bb723c3fa494cafaa32182c4d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787538922", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4859490/9bb90212c4536f8bb723c3fa494cafaa32182c4d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787538922", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphi